SUMMARY:MEng and MEngCEM Application Strategies & Tips
DESCRIPTION:🗓️ Tuesday\, November 10\, 2026\n🕑 9:00am (ET)\n📋 REGISTER HERE   \nJoin Admissions & Recruitment Coordinator Pauline Martini and Admissions Officer & Student Services Advisor Lyndsay Vair for this engaging presentation outlining tips and strategies to help you submit a CivMin MEng or MEngCEM admission application with confidence! \nOur professional master’s programs offer exciting courses\, dynamic hands-on learning through projects and practicums and provide endless opportunities to expand your expertise and fast-track your career journey. Students can customize their MEng program to align with their passions by choosing one or more of 17 optional areas of emphasis. \nThe presentation will be followed by a Q&A session where you can ask all your application-related questions.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/meng-and-mengcem-application-strategies-tips/
CATEGORIES:Info sessions
END:VEVENT
