SUMMARY:Summer Research Exchange Program: APS299 and Non-Credit Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Date: Tuesday\, November 10\, 2026\nTime: 12:00pm to 1:00pm\nLocation: Hybrid  \nInterested in gaining hands-on in person research experience abroad? The Centre for International Experience\, in collaboration with Engineering\, will present about the Summer Research Exchange Program on Tuesday\, November 10 at 12pm. The session will highlight international destinations open to Engineering students and include information on APS299 and the non-credit opportunity.  \nJoin us in person in Room BA2175 (Bahen Centre for Information Technology\, 40 St. George St.) or online on Zoom (link to join online).  \nPizza refreshments provided to in-person attendees! Please register here.  \nQuestions? Please email undergrad.research@engineering.utoronto.ca  
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/summer-research-exchange-program-aps299-and-non-credit-information-session/
LOCATION:Hybrid – Zoom & BA2175
CATEGORIES:Info sessions
