SUMMARY:Hong Kong: Technical visit in Shenzhen
DESCRIPTION:From Toronto to Shenzhen: Connecting engineers with global innovation \nJoin Dean Chris Yip and fellow U of T Engineering alumni for an exclusive behind-the-scenes visit to Shenzhen InnoX Academy and Tencent Holdings Limited\, two organizations at the forefront of technology\, entrepreneurship and innovation. \nWhether you are an entrepreneur\, investor\, engineer\, or business leader\, this unique opportunity offers a firsthand look at how world-class organizations turn ideas into products\, scale innovation and shape the future. \nUofT Engineering alumni have first priority for this visit. Each alumni may request to bring ONE (1) friend. Admission will be confirmed after the registration deadline. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvent information:\n\nDate: Wednesday\, November 11\, 2026\nSchedule:  \n\n8:00 am Pick up at Kowloon Tong Station (exact location tbc)\n10:00am Visit and discussions at Shenzhen InnoX Academy\n12:30pm Lunch\n2:00pm Visit and discussions at Tencent Holdings Limited\n4:00pm Return to Hong Kong\n5:30pm Drop off at Kowloon Tong MTR Station\n\nLanguage: English and Chinese\nFee: Lunch shared at cost (estimate under CNY150)\nRegistration deadline: November 4\, 2026 (or when capacity is reached)\n\nClick to see the event flyer for details.\n\nQuestions? uteaahk@gmail.com
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/hong-kong-technical-visit-in-shenzhen/
LOCATION:Pick up at Kowloon Tong MTR Station
CATEGORIES:Alumni events
END:VEVENT
