SUMMARY:Kuala Lumpur: Alumni meet-up
DESCRIPTION:Attention U of T Engineering alumni in Kuala Lumpur!  \nJoin Dean Chris Yip for a small dinner with fellow U of T Engineering alumni in Kuala Lumpur. We’re looking forward to an evening of conversation\, good food and meaningful connections with members of our alumni community.   \nWe’d like to hear where your life and engineering degree have taken you and provide you with updates on what’s happening at the faculty.  \nWe hope to see you there!   \nEvent Details:\nDate: Saturday\, November 14\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 p.m.  – 8:30 p.m.\nLocation: RAW Restaurant inside Else Kuala Lumpur\, 145 Jalan Tun H. S. Lee\, City Centre\, 50000 Kuala Lumpur\, Malaysia(opens in new tab)\nCost: Free  \n Register by November 10(opens in new tab)  \nQuestions? \nEmail events@engineering.utoronto.ca \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDiscover your Global Alumni Ambassadors (GAA) around the world—visit our GAA site for more details!
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/kuala-lumpur-alumni-meet-up/
LOCATION:RAW Restaurant inside Else Kuala Lumpur\, 145 Jalan Tun H. S. Lee\, City Centre\, 50000 Kuala Lumpur\, Malaysia
CATEGORIES:Alumni events
END:VEVENT
